notes.content:
1. Added the display of the activity level in the friends list;
2. Added sorting options to friends list and alliance member list;
3. Added the function of multiple selection of “Merge”； 
4. Added the function that military units can automatically continue their production, and the default of this function is “off”;
5. Added luminous effect to the “Flower Garden” of Persian civilization;
6. Added the function to input numbers directly when training, building and splitting armies.

1. Adjusted the training resources of certain units;
2. Adjusted the “Angry Slay” skill to one that can be accumulated for multiple times;
3. Adjusted the upper limit of “Reorganize”skill of Imperial General to 10 times;
4. Canceled the reduction in the damage of long-range attacks triggered by the long-range units.
5. Fixed other known problems.

The night view mode is available for all civilizations in Sim Empire.
1. The night view mode for Persian and Aztec Civilization is released at the same time;
2. “Subgrade perspective mode” is online for you to check the safety coverage and environment attributes comprehensively;
3. Members of the alliance will be displayed in the order of their activity levels;
4. Added “obsidian” into the resource selection for skill points;
5. Restored the “Logout” button in the Setting Panel.

The night view mode is available for all civilizations in Sim Empire.
1. The night view mode for Persian and Aztec Civilization is released at the same time;
2. “Subgrade perspective mode” is online for you to check the safety coverage and environment attributes comprehensively;
3. Members of the alliance will be displayed in the order of their activity levels;
4. Added “obsidian” into the resource selection for skill points;
5. Restored the “Logout” button in the Setting Panel.

1. Added the function of “shovel one section of road at a time”;
2. Optimized the needed time for S&T studying comprehensively;
3. Fixed the display problem of military units in “Focus the Battlefield”;
4. Fixed the problem that the “little red dot” does not disappear after checking;
5. Added the "+" button in the trading center to directly jump to the bottom for the pending orders;
6. Added “purchase” button in the secondary menu of resources, so you can directly bid to purchase the resources;
7. Optimized the content display of friends' dynamics to reduce the display of excessive items.

1. [Night of the Nile] The Night View of Egyptian civilization is fully released;
2. Fixed a possible problem concerning the “jump” of “Eagle Warrior” in Aztec civilization;
3. Fixed possible problems after being entangled by “Wizard” in Aztec civilization.

1. Adjusted the population occupied by Horus, Wizards, Judge, and Feathered Snake God;
2. Adjusted the skill tree of some units in Aztec civilization;
3. Fixed some problems with the wizard’s skill of “Entangle” on the battlefield;
4. Fixed other known problems.

1. Night view of the flourishing Chinese civilization;
2. Fixed the problem of automatic workers assignment for buildings;
3. Added the function of switching to other civilizations;
4. Fixed the incomplete changes in night view mode.
